          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அஞ்சலி — añcali — \"a tribute; homage\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "மக்கள் அவருக்கு அஞ்சலி செலுத்தினார்கள். makkaḷ avarukku añcali celuttiṉārkaḷ. The people paid tribute to him."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அஞ்சலி (añcali) செலுத்து, to pay homage; the person honoured takes -க்கு."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அஞ்சலி (añcali) is borrowed from Sanskrit añjali, \"the hollowed hands placed together\" (CDIAL 171), the gesture of homage."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
